      <h2>Company overview</h2>
      <p><strong>AI Tool Hub</strong> is an independent, reader-supported publication that helps knowledge workers, developers, designers, and marketers find the right AI tools for their work. We publish expert reviews, hands-on guides, and comparison articles on the 30+ AI tools that matter in 2026.</p>

      <p><strong>Founded:</strong> 2025.</p>
      <p><strong>Headquarters:</strong> Singapore (remote-first, 5 employees in 4 countries).</p>
      <p><strong>Mission:</strong> Help 1 million knowledge workers use AI to do better work in less time by 2030.</p>
      <p><strong>Audience:</strong> 200,000+ monthly readers, 80% knowledge workers, 20% developers/designers/marketers.</p>
      <p><strong>Funding:</strong> Profitable, bootstrapped, no external funding.</p>
      <p><strong>Business model:</strong> Affiliate partnerships with AI vendors (disclosed), display advertising (Google AdSense, disclosed), sponsored content (clearly labeled).</p>

      <h2>Fact sheet (Q3 2026)</h2>

      <h3>By the numbers</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>200,000+</strong> monthly active readers</li>
        <li><strong>145+</strong> pages of original content</li>
        <li><strong>30+</strong> AI tools reviewed in depth</li>
        <li><strong>20+</strong> expert reviewers on the team</li>
        <li><strong>2,500+</strong> hours of hands-on testing in 2026</li>
        <li><strong>1,000+</strong> reader survey responses in 2026</li>
        <li><strong>5</strong> major content categories: writing, coding, image, video, audio</li>
        <li><strong>24</strong> AI tool categories covered</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Editorial standards</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>4,000+ words</strong> average length of a deep-dive review</li>
        <li><strong>2-4 weeks</strong> average hands-on testing time per tool</li>
        <li><strong>2 reviewers</strong> independently test every paid tool</li>
        <li><strong>5-dimension rubric</strong> used for every tool review (quality, ease of use, value, support, fit)</li>
        <li><strong>Quarterly re-reviews</strong> of major tools to catch updates</li>
        <li><strong>Full disclosure</strong> of all affiliate and sponsored relationships</li>
      </ul>

