      <h2>Quotes we can provide on the record</h2>
      <p>We can provide the following quotes on the record. For longer interviews or off-the-record conversations, email us.</p>

      <p><strong>On the AI tool landscape:</strong> "In 2026, the AI tool landscape is consolidating. The 12 tools that cover 95% of knowledge work are clear. The question is not which tool to use, but how to use it well." - Lin Chen, Lead Reviewer</p>

      <p><strong>On small teams using AI:</strong> "The teams that win in 2026 are the teams that use AI to do production work, freeing humans to do judgment work. Our case studies show 2-3x productivity gains with the same headcount." - Daniel Park, Marketing Lead</p>

      <p><strong>On AI content quality:</strong> "AI slop is the failure mode. Quality AI-assisted content is better than most pre-AI content because it is faster, more thoroughly researched, and more carefully edited. The difference is process, not tools." - Lin Chen, Lead Reviewer</p>

